    "detailed_description": "Guide the colorful slime to the goal.<br />\r\nAll you have to do is decide the order and timing of the slimes.<br />\r\nIf even one person reaches the goal, the stage is cleared.<br />\r\nThere are 50 stages in total! A casual puzzle game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRed slime...When it becomes a block, it stays in place!<br />\r\nBlue slime...can jump over high steps! When it becomes a block, it becomes a jumping platform!<br />\r\nGreen slime... it falls when it becomes a block!<br />\r\nYellow slime...it floats on the edge of the cliff! Even if it becomes a block, it will float!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOn the play screen, you can &quot;retry&quot;, &quot;fast forward&quot;, and &quot;pause&quot;, and from the pause screen, you can &quot;pass the stage&quot; and &quot;adjust the volume&quot;.",
